      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y’know, I had this idea for a new ultra-hardcore\ntraining challenge. Wanna try it out?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t worry, the rules are super simple.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E2019007400200077006F007200720079002C0020007400680065002000720075006C006500730020006100720065002000730075007000650072002000730069006D0070006C0065002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re stuck in a room with some wild Pokémon\nand you gotta dodge their attacks. That’s it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Easy, right? You can just send out your Pokémon,\nor throw a Poké Ball and try to catch ’em, yeah?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nBzzzt. Nope. None of that’s gonna fly.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s just you and your reflexes. I call it...the\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Defenseless Dodger<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> challenge!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nGimme a shout when you’re feeling brave.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
