      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then let’s see if you can last <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>30 seconds<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nGet ready for a jolt of high-voltage excitement—\nit’s Defenseless Dodger time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
